  "work": "Tianjin Eye is a separately ticketed observation wheel on Yongle Bridge over the Haihe. English, Chinese and broad-city official editor Park/Standalone searches found no same-site record; Fantawild Adventure Tianjin is a different distant park and Tianjin Shuishang Park has a separate wheel project. Created hidden with eight authored descriptions, recent Ctrip weekly hours, official April 2026 day/night adult fares, 2009 opening and 2023 gondola-renewal history, and four exact Commons photographs including a 2019 aerial view labelled historical. Audited and published site and Facebook.",
